---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON THE DATA, WHICH IS NOT COVERED BY THE LICENCE ABOVE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository. The data cached in
data/ and reproduced in docs/index.html comes from two external sources and
remains under their terms:

Statistics Canada
  Monthly GDP by industry (table 36-10-0434-01) and the text of The Daily.
  Contains information licensed under the Statistics Canada Open Licence:
  https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/reference/licence
  That licence permits reproduction and adaptation provided Statistics Canada
  is acknowledged as the source and the reproduction is not represented as an
  official version, nor as having been made in affiliation with or with the
  endorsement of Statistics Canada.

Bank of Canada
  Target for the overnight rate, via the Valet API, used under the Bank of
  Canada's Terms of Use: https://www.bankofcanada.ca/terms/

Neither institution endorses this project or is affiliated with it. No
Bloomberg data, screenshots, or exports are used anywhere in this repository.
